WEBVTT

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:02.511
and respect for its ability
to control our climate.

00:13:03.591 --> 00:13:05.171
And if we do so,

00:13:05.195 --> 00:13:07.649
we can then simultaneously address

00:13:07.673 --> 00:13:12.036
two of the most pressing
global challenges of our time:

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.696
climate change and soil degradation.

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:20.903
And in the process, we would be able
to provide food and nutritional security

00:13:20.927 --> 00:13:22.783
to our growing human family.

00:13:23.441 --> 00:13:24.592
Thank you.

00:13:24.616 --> 00:13:29.238
(Applause)